{"id":2061,"level":79,"name":"Комбінація (3)","group":"Комбінація","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>A combination involves using multiple tactical concepts at the same time. Sometimes you also sacrifice material temporarily, in order to win it back with interest.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by means of a combination.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":95,"examples":[{"fen":"r4rk1/pp1nbppp/2p2n2/q3p1B1/4P3/1BN3Q1/PPP2PPP/2KR3R w - - 0 12","pgn":"12. Rxd7 Nxd7 13. Bxe7 * ","text":"<p>Білі можуть змусити вигідний розмін за допомогою <strong>1.Rxd7!</strong> Дві фігури значно сильніші за туру.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1b1kb1r/4nppp/pq2p3/1p1pP3/3n4/P1NB1N2/1P3PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w kq - 0 11","pgn":"11. Nxd4 Qxd4 12. Bxb5+ axb5 13. Qxd4 * ","text":"<p>кінь на d4 покритий, але у білих є хитрість! Після розміну білі мають виграшний відкритий чек.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r4rk1/ppq2ppp/1n1bp3/2n5/2P5/5N2/PP2QPPP/RNBR2K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. b4 {[%csl Gb4,Rc5][%cal Gb4c5]} Nca4 2. c5 {[%csl Gb4,Rb6,Gc5,Rd6][%cal Gb4c5,Gc5b6,Gc5d6]} Nxc5 3. bxc5 {[%csl Gc5]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77333,"fen":"r4rk1/4p1bp/p1n3q1/3p1b2/1p1P1B2/2PB1N2/PP1N1P1Q/2K4R w - - 0 18","pgn":"{[%csl Rf5,Rg6][%evp 0,3,114,136,139,139]} {Q=2} 18. Nh4 {P=1}  Bxd3 19. Nxg6 * ","format":27,"texts":["Раптом чорні більше не можуть покривати всі фігури.","Існує загроза форка!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77336,"fen":"r1b2rk1/1pq3pp/p1n1pn2/2bp4/3N1P2/1BP1B3/PP4PP/RN1Q1R1K w - - 0 15","pgn":"{[%csl Rc5,Re6][%evp 0,3,102,92,88,48]} {Q=2} 15. Nxe6  {P=1} Bxe6 16. Bxc5 * ","format":27,"texts":["With a small combo, White wins an important pawn.","Consider different options for a discovered attack."],"text":"Note that it's important for the white king to be on h1. This prevents Black from having an in-between check with ...Bxe3.","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":773